 (rc msg)←{add}SendMail_CrashReport INI;domain;folder;list;filename;body;attachments;subject;CC
⍝ Sends a crash report to whoever is listed in "EMAIL:To" and "EMAIL:CC".
⍝ You may add additional information to the standard crash email by passing `add`.
⍝ This must be a simple character vector.
⍝ The email as such is sent by `SendMail`.
 msg←'' ⋄ rc←0
 :If INI.Get'EMAIL:active'
     add←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ ''}'add'
     '⍺ must be a simple character vector'##.Reg.Assert(⎕DR add)∊80 160
     domain←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:Domain'
     body←⊂'<DOMAIN>'⎕R domain⊣⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:Body'
     :If 0<≢add
         body,←⊆add
     :EndIf
     attachments←⍬
     folder←⊃INI.Get'TRAP:Folder'
     :If 0<≢list←##.F.ListFiles folder,'*.html'
         filename←⊃¯1↑list
         attachments←,⊂filename'text/html'
     :EndIf
     subject←(domain,' has crashed')
     CC←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:CC'
     (rc msg)←attachments SendMail INI subject body CC
 :EndIf
⍝Done
